PRP-C1: Full Clause Citation System with LangExtract Augmentation
Started: 2025-08-31
Branch: rules-engine-refactor
Status: IN PROGRESS
Priority: CRITICAL - COUNCIL MVP BLOCKER

Objective: Implement complete clause citations using enhanced LangExtract to provide 
full regulatory paragraph text instead of summaries.

FOUNDATION DISCOVERED:
✅ apply_langextract_to_a3_5.py - Existing LangExtract processing script
✅ examples/regulatory-engine/langextract_config.py - LangExtract schema config
✅ validated_outputs/A3_5_langextract_grounded.json - 47KB processed data

CURRENT ISSUE:
- System only shows summarized clause text
- Councils need complete authoritative regulatory paragraphs
- Existing LangExtract simulates output via Gemini, not true library usage

ENHANCEMENT PLAN:
1. Enhance langextract_config.py for full clause paragraph extraction
2. Implement services/full_clause_extractor.py using existing foundation
3. Create clause_number → full_text mapping storage
4. Update API responses to include complete citations
5. Enhance frontend to display full regulatory text

SUCCESS CRITERIA:
- Frontend displays complete regulatory paragraph text
- All clause numbers have full text mappings
- Council staff can copy authoritative citations
- < 2 second citation retrieval performance

This PRP blocks council MVP demonstration - complete citations are mandatory for regulatory authority.